WEBVTT

00:02.350 --> 00:07.690
It's been decided that I'll be the
fifth years' manager for the day!

00:07.980 --> 00:09.150
Nice meeting you guys!

00:11.320 --> 00:13.780
Why's he coaching us all of a sudden?

00:13.780 --> 00:16.070
Yeah, what gives? Can we trust you?

00:16.320 --> 00:19.070
Of course. Ginga is the strongest.

00:19.070 --> 00:20.990
Even if you say that...

00:21.240 --> 00:23.370
You all want to win, right?

00:23.370 --> 00:24.160
Yes.

00:24.160 --> 00:25.870
I have a great plan.

00:25.870 --> 00:26.870
Really?

00:28.580 --> 00:30.330
Please tell us.

00:30.330 --> 00:30.880
Okay!

00:31.880 --> 00:33.460
Hasegawa-san?

00:33.460 --> 00:38.630
I asked my dad to be their coach, just for today.

00:38.630 --> 00:41.260
What? Are you betraying us, Subaru?

00:41.430 --> 00:42.930
It's nothing like that!

00:42.930 --> 00:46.770
If I don't do this, then we'll beat them by sheer power alone.

00:46.930 --> 00:48.390
Oh, that's right.

00:48.390 --> 00:49.940
You have a point.

00:49.940 --> 00:56.940
Subaru-san's dad will give them advice that will allow everyone to touch the ball.

00:56.940 --> 00:57.690
You're right.

00:58.070 --> 01:02.950
The fifth-years don't understand yet that basketball is a game that needs all five players.

01:03.280 --> 01:05.490
The match just got a lot more fun.

01:05.490 --> 01:08.460
Oh! I want things to get more fun, too!

01:10.170 --> 01:10.960
All right!

01:12.420 --> 01:15.550
Make them see that halation!

01:15.550 --> 01:18.970
We'll carry out the oath we made that day.

01:18.970 --> 01:22.010
Spread out, new formation!

01:22.010 --> 01:25.520
We can see the signs as we call out for one another.

01:25.520 --> 01:31.770
Place your hopes in it, shoot, and watch the arch!

01:32.060 --> 01:36.690
I believe in you, do it like you always do.

01:36.690 --> 01:38.360
Leave it to me.

01:38.360 --> 01:44.910
Put your hands on your chest, and calm yourself down.

01:44.910 --> 01:51.250
I remember each and every granted wish,

01:51.250 --> 01:57.130
including that day I cried in secret.

01:57.130 --> 02:00.590
We're not the only ones

02:00.590 --> 02:04.180
seeing these same dreams.

02:04.180 --> 02:07.810
The sparks in those unyielding eyes

02:07.810 --> 02:10.940
that appeared in front of me,

02:10.940 --> 02:12.480
let them fly!

02:12.770 --> 02:15.900
Make them see that halation!

02:15.900 --> 02:19.280
Run into that open space!

02:19.280 --> 02:25.910
This lingering sensation, looking back on those carefree days.

02:25.910 --> 02:32.460
After saying farewell, you smile with everyone else,

02:32.460 --> 02:38.710
aim for the place you dreamed of, shoot, and watch the arch!

02:41.010 --> 02:45.390
Paradigm Ginga

02:47.600 --> 02:48.620
Kagetsu!

02:48.810 --> 02:49.290
Okay!

02:55.810 --> 02:56.660
Hii!

02:56.900 --> 02:58.050
Okay!

03:01.460 --> 03:02.630
What?!

03:03.550 --> 03:04.630
So fast!

03:06.590 --> 03:07.050
Ge-tan!

03:07.220 --> 03:08.220
Okay!

03:10.720 --> 03:12.010
<i>She'll shoot like this?</i>

03:14.260 --> 03:15.020
Masami!

03:19.980 --> 03:22.310
Masami... Amazing...

03:22.980 --> 03:24.480
She's good!

03:24.480 --> 03:28.150
Nothing less from a girl so
confident in her shooting skills!

03:28.150 --> 03:31.030
If this was an actual match, that
would have been a three pointer.

03:31.030 --> 03:33.740
Masami-san's been practicing a lot.

03:33.740 --> 03:37.040
And Kagetsu-chan's movements...

03:37.040 --> 03:39.120
That's not something you can learn in a day.

03:39.500 --> 03:42.040
Hinata taught her well.

03:42.040 --> 03:45.920
I'm sure she's been practicing her post play since she's so tall.

03:47.090 --> 03:48.510
You're pretty knowledgeable.

03:49.130 --> 03:50.970
N-Not really.

03:52.640 --> 03:57.470
<i>I asked Dad to help out, but this team has gotten tough to beat.</i>

04:00.480 --> 04:03.730
Their off-the-ball movement has gotten much better.

04:03.730 --> 04:04.730
What did you do?

04:05.480 --> 04:06.940
What do you think?

04:24.960 --> 04:26.460
Oh!

04:45.030 --> 04:47.260
6th Years

04:45.030 --> 04:47.260
5th Years

04:48.750 --> 04:51.540
The fifth-years are pretty good.

04:51.540 --> 04:54.290
Yeah, they got a lot quicker.

04:54.290 --> 04:57.880
I didn't expect that level of play.

04:58.170 --> 05:00.260
Kage-chan is amazing!

05:00.260 --> 05:03.010
She never gave up on challenging me for the ball.

05:03.010 --> 05:04.300
Oh!

05:04.300 --> 05:06.180
Nice play from my sister!

05:06.180 --> 05:08.850
All right! Keep it up!

05:08.850 --> 05:10.140
Will do!

05:10.140 --> 05:11.940
We won't lose, either! Let's go!

05:12.140 --> 05:13.560
Yeah!

05:14.770 --> 05:15.360
Maho-chan!

05:15.360 --> 05:16.150
I've got this!

05:20.860 --> 05:22.400
Hey, Dad.

05:23.400 --> 05:25.860
I think I've figured out your tactic.

05:26.950 --> 05:29.030
Wait, what? What do you mean?

05:29.950 --> 05:32.160
Well, it's not really a tactic.

05:32.160 --> 05:36.960
It's kind of like volleyball. You're
switching up when they pass and shoot.

05:38.040 --> 05:39.420
Correct.

05:39.420 --> 05:42.460
That's Coach Subaru for you. How did you figure it out?

05:42.460 --> 05:45.340
Something seemed weird about your strategy.

05:45.340 --> 05:49.510
Why didn't the same player shoot consecutively?

05:49.510 --> 05:52.270
For example, when Kagetsu-chan got the rebound,

05:52.270 --> 05:55.140
she passed up on a great shot.

05:56.230 --> 05:57.600
I guess so.

05:57.770 --> 06:03.320
So I thought maybe you were having them shoot in order.

06:03.820 --> 06:04.690
Tsubaki-chan,

06:04.690 --> 06:05.570
Masami-san,

06:05.570 --> 06:06.650
Hiiragi-chan,

06:06.650 --> 06:07.570
Kagetsu-chan,

06:07.570 --> 06:08.530
Mimi-chan.

06:09.160 --> 06:10.370
Was that the order?

06:10.490 --> 06:11.490
Well, well!

06:11.490 --> 06:13.450
That's my boy!

06:15.830 --> 06:20.040
But I didn't think they'd agree to play like that all of a sudden.

06:20.340 --> 06:21.590
You'd be right.

06:21.590 --> 06:24.960
That's why I gave them a goal to work towards.

06:25.470 --> 06:26.630
"Goal"?

06:26.970 --> 06:32.010
I said that if they can keep this up for the entire game, I'll treat them all to ice cream.

06:32.310 --> 06:33.720
I see.

06:33.720 --> 06:37.480
You didn't <i>force</i> them to play like that, you made them <i>want</i> to.

06:37.730 --> 06:41.110
Basketball isn't all about shooting.

06:41.770 --> 06:46.440
I felt that it was important for them to understand that by changing their perspective of things.

06:48.320 --> 06:52.030
Your dad's a basketball pro, unlike you.

06:52.030 --> 06:53.700
What are you trying to say?

06:55.910 --> 06:56.580
Ge-tan!

06:56.870 --> 06:57.580
Here!

06:59.500 --> 07:03.420
<i>Ge-tan didn't shoot back then.</i>

07:03.420 --> 07:05.340
<i>The one who shot then was...</i>

07:09.680 --> 07:10.390
Oh no!

07:17.230 --> 07:20.310
I'm too flabbergasted to talk, Masami.

07:21.560 --> 07:24.020
I'll knock you off your throne!

07:28.320 --> 07:29.530
Oh!

07:29.530 --> 07:30.240
Maho!

07:31.280 --> 07:33.160
I won't lose!

07:33.580 --> 07:34.410
Maho!

07:38.290 --> 07:39.120
I got it!

07:40.920 --> 07:41.500
Tsuba!

07:41.790 --> 07:43.290
Nice, Hii!

07:53.430 --> 07:55.430
6th Years

07:53.430 --> 07:55.430
5th Years

07:55.760 --> 07:58.100
Tomo! guard Mimi-chan, please!

07:58.100 --> 07:58.930
Okay!

07:59.770 --> 08:03.560
Airi! Ge-tan can't shoot long
jumpers, so guard her closely.

08:03.560 --> 08:04.230
Okay!

08:04.560 --> 08:07.360
Maho, Hina! Mark TsubaHii tightly!

08:07.360 --> 08:08.570
Break up their passes!

08:08.570 --> 08:09.860
Okay!

08:08.570 --> 08:09.860
Oh!

08:13.410 --> 08:14.530
It's mine!

08:15.160 --> 08:15.700
Saki!

08:26.340 --> 08:29.840
I'll do my best, too, so I don't lose to you.

08:33.760 --> 08:36.470
Tomoka, let's go one-on-one again.

08:36.470 --> 08:37.680
Yeah.

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
Name

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
Hakamada Kagetsu

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
Date of birth

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
Class

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
Height

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
Bust size

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
Rival

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
Hakamada Hinata (She really respects her older
sister, and her goal is to become a
basketball player like her.)

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
The biggest among the entire 5th year class.

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
5th Year, Class D

08:46.070 --> 08:48.990
Blood type

09:04.250 --> 09:07.130
<i>That's the move Subaru-san was always practicing!</i>

09:07.880 --> 09:08.760
Not a chance!

09:19.520 --> 09:21.560
A floater, huh?

09:21.560 --> 09:24.520
She only makes that a few times, though.

09:29.030 --> 09:30.150
Oh!

09:30.150 --> 09:32.530
Tomoka-chan's shooting a floater, too?

09:35.030 --> 09:35.990
<i>I'll stop her!</i>

09:39.330 --> 09:40.290
Here, Hinata!

09:40.290 --> 09:41.290
Oh!

09:41.290 --> 09:42.290
Nice pass!

09:48.670 --> 09:50.920
She didn't go one-on-one.

09:50.920 --> 09:53.260
That's great teamwork.

09:54.930 --> 09:57.350
I lost again.

09:57.350 --> 10:02.440
Yeah, because we'll always be playing as a team!

10:02.440 --> 10:04.940
6th Years

10:02.440 --> 10:04.940
5th Years

10:05.400 --> 10:07.320
Thank you very much!

10:09.940 --> 10:11.740
How frustrating!

10:11.740 --> 10:14.450
Get some more practice in, TsubaHii!

10:14.450 --> 10:17.830
That's right! You've never really
practiced as a team before, right?

10:18.330 --> 10:20.830
You can't beat us like that.

10:22.330 --> 10:25.210
Um, if you don't have a place to practice,

10:25.210 --> 10:29.500
I think we should all practice together.

10:30.800 --> 10:33.630
Let's practice together, right, Masami?

10:33.800 --> 10:37.220
S-Stop joking around! We don't need your pity!

10:37.220 --> 10:38.810
Yeah, that's right!

10:38.810 --> 10:41.140
You guys can use this court for now!

10:44.100 --> 10:46.020
Good game, Nee-sama.

10:46.020 --> 10:47.360
Oh!

10:47.360 --> 10:49.400
That match was so much fun!

10:49.400 --> 10:51.990
Kage-chan, you did great!

10:51.990 --> 10:53.360
Thank you very much.

10:55.700 --> 10:59.490
Tomoka, we'll play again. I won't lose next time.

10:59.870 --> 11:00.830
Okay.

11:00.830 --> 11:02.500
We won't lose, either.

11:15.050 --> 11:17.340
You girls played well for a new team.

11:17.340 --> 11:18.640
That was amazing.

11:23.270 --> 11:27.900
Well, if you want to shake off that losing feeling, then you've gotta train hard as a team, okay?

11:27.900 --> 11:30.900
Ginga, will you continue coaching us?

11:31.320 --> 11:36.610
I'd love to, but I have to get back to Hawaii soon.

11:36.610 --> 11:40.990
Also, I've found someone even more suitable than me.

11:45.040 --> 11:47.190
I bought the ice cream!

11:48.040 --> 11:49.290
Who's that?

11:49.290 --> 11:54.690
Subaru's childhood friend, and from now on, your coach, Aoi-chan.

11:56.670 --> 11:59.640
I'm Ogiyama Aoi. Nice to meet all of you.

11:59.640 --> 12:02.060
You're his childhood friend?

12:02.060 --> 12:03.470
Will you be really okay?

12:13.520 --> 12:15.070
What a beautiful layup!

12:15.070 --> 12:16.400
See?

12:16.400 --> 12:17.950
She'll be fine, right?

12:19.240 --> 12:21.660
Let's try and beat the sixth-years, okay?

12:21.990 --> 12:24.120
Stupid Maho is gonna get wrecked!

12:24.870 --> 12:27.170
I'm fine as long as I beat Saki.

12:27.170 --> 12:28.920
And I'll beat Tomoka.

12:28.920 --> 12:30.710
Let's all work hard.

12:30.710 --> 12:32.170
I'm looking forward to this.

12:32.170 --> 12:34.250
Me too. Thank you everyone.

12:38.470 --> 12:40.060
Good play, Tomoka.

12:40.760 --> 12:43.850
You've always done well, but
you're actually quite amazing.

12:43.850 --> 12:44.970
Not really...

12:44.970 --> 12:49.060
It's because you've been always watching over me as the coach.

12:49.640 --> 12:57.070
That move Mimi-chan did... I was able to block it because I watched you practice it in the mornings.

12:57.080 --> 12:59.330
Ah, the floater?

13:01.540 --> 13:06.090
If you can, please teach me how to shoot it.

13:06.420 --> 13:07.880
All right.

13:08.670 --> 13:11.590
I haven't mastered it yet, though.

13:16.220 --> 13:19.850
I know it was a sudden request, but thanks, Aoi.

13:19.850 --> 13:24.690
It's fine. I've always been
interested in coaching kids.

13:24.690 --> 13:27.860
No, really. You're a lifesaver.

13:28.480 --> 13:30.400
I'll have to thank you properly.

13:30.400 --> 13:33.870
Th-That's fine! Don't worry about it.

13:35.830 --> 13:37.660
That game was so much fun!

13:37.660 --> 13:40.410
I hope we can play together again someday!

13:40.410 --> 13:41.620
Oh!

13:41.620 --> 13:43.420
I'm looking forward to it!

13:43.420 --> 13:46.670
I wanted all of us to be on the same team,

13:46.670 --> 13:48.050
but I guess it's not a big deal.

13:48.050 --> 13:50.420
Oh yeah, Mokkan! Did you finish it?

13:50.420 --> 13:52.300
That thing you were going to give Subaru.

13:52.300 --> 13:54.510
Your birthday party invitation?

13:54.510 --> 13:56.260
Y-Yes! I finished it!

13:56.260 --> 13:58.510
But it's a bit embarrassing...

13:58.510 --> 14:01.480
You have to work hard at it, no matter how embarrassing it is.

14:01.480 --> 14:02.810
Oh!

14:02.810 --> 14:04.730
Are you going to give it to him tomorrow?

14:04.730 --> 14:05.350
Yeah!

14:05.350 --> 14:06.860
I'll do my best!

14:11.110 --> 14:15.910
I-I'll be holding a birthday party this Saturday...

14:16.620 --> 14:18.160
Everyone else is coming.

14:18.160 --> 14:21.660
I was wondering if you'd like to come, too...

14:23.580 --> 14:27.590
I'll be glad to! I hope I won't be too much of a bother.

14:27.670 --> 14:30.210
O-Of course you won't!

14:30.210 --> 14:33.300
Won't you be busy though?

14:33.300 --> 14:36.550
There's nothing more important than your birthday party, Tomoka.

14:37.600 --> 14:42.020
Th-Thank you very much! I'll be awaiting you!

14:45.190 --> 14:47.770
<i>I've gotta buy a present...</i>

14:47.770 --> 14:49.770
<i>What should I get her?</i>

14:49.770 --> 14:51.110
Subaru!

14:53.540 --> 14:55.040
Hey! What's up?

14:55.580 --> 14:59.300
Kazunari said he found someone to join our club.

14:59.300 --> 15:01.210
Oh! Really?

15:01.580 --> 15:07.580
Narayama, my friend since middle school, gave me a heads-up on someone from our school.

15:07.580 --> 15:10.920
Don't tell me he's from Hashida Middle School, Kashima...

15:11.340 --> 15:13.550
Hashida Middle's ace?

15:13.550 --> 15:15.880
Huh, was his name Kashima?

15:15.880 --> 15:18.390
I don't really know.

15:18.390 --> 15:23.560
But here's his cell phone number. Why don't you talk to him yourself?

15:24.430 --> 15:25.520
Please!

15:27.140 --> 15:32.480
That's brilliant! It feels like
something great is about to start!

15:32.820 --> 15:33.730
Yeah!

15:33.730 --> 15:38.240
I'll have to buy new balls after school to mark the occasion!

15:38.990 --> 15:41.370
Hey, Aoi, can I come with you?

15:49.040 --> 15:53.710
I don't think I can choose by myself.

15:53.710 --> 15:55.050
Choose what?

15:55.670 --> 16:01.550
I've always been under her care, so this time I want to take it seriously.

16:02.010 --> 16:03.510
You mean...

16:03.510 --> 16:05.730
Yeah, a present.

16:06.810 --> 16:10.900
We're always together, so I don't know what to choose.

16:11.310 --> 16:14.650
I think you can choose better than I can.

16:16.650 --> 16:20.070
No way! I told you I didn't need anything special.

16:20.070 --> 16:23.200
Y-You don't need to worry about me.

16:23.200 --> 16:26.410
And I'm sure I can accept
anything from you, Subaru.

16:26.410 --> 16:31.790
That's no good. Women have very particular tastes.

16:31.790 --> 16:33.540
What should I choose?

16:33.880 --> 16:37.010
What? Um...

16:38.840 --> 16:43.010
I think Tomoka would like
something related to basketball.

16:43.010 --> 16:45.510
Yeah! Something related to basketball...

16:46.890 --> 16:47.890
What?

16:48.480 --> 16:50.810
Tomoka's birthday present.

16:50.810 --> 16:53.690
I've been thinking about a few things, but it's hard to decide.

16:53.690 --> 16:55.610
T-Tomoka-chan?

16:55.610 --> 16:58.030
O-Oh yeah! That's right!

16:58.030 --> 17:01.030
Yeah, of course. Dead on.

17:01.030 --> 17:02.450
It has to be about basketball, right?

17:05.280 --> 17:06.540
What's wrong?

17:06.540 --> 17:09.210
No, it's nothing...

17:10.080 --> 17:11.580
Thank you very much.

17:12.250 --> 17:15.460
Thanks, Aoi. I think this is perfect.

17:15.460 --> 17:17.960
Y-Yeah, that's great.

17:23.430 --> 17:25.220
Cheers!

17:25.550 --> 17:28.390
Tomoka, happy birthday!

17:28.390 --> 17:30.310
Thank you for the invitation.

17:30.310 --> 17:34.810
Y-You're welcome. Thank you very much for coming.

17:35.940 --> 17:38.110
This chicken is so yummy!

17:38.110 --> 17:39.570
Yep!

17:39.570 --> 17:44.160
My, that's great! Eat up, everyone.

17:44.660 --> 17:47.870
Will Tomoka become a great cook in the future, too?

17:49.160 --> 17:50.710
I wonder about that...

17:52.340 --> 17:54.220
I'll teach her well!

17:54.630 --> 17:58.710
Tomoka's cooking... I'll be looking forward to it.

18:00.230 --> 18:02.770
Subaru! Eat my cooking, too!

18:02.770 --> 18:05.110
Oh! I'll cook, too!

18:05.110 --> 18:09.940
Me too! I may not be very good at it, but I'll do my best!

18:09.940 --> 18:13.020
You can't live on pancakes alone, you know.

18:13.230 --> 18:15.020
Y-Yeah.

18:15.020 --> 18:16.980
I'm looking forward to it.

18:21.030 --> 18:23.070
Thanks for the food.

18:23.070 --> 18:27.240
Oh! Onii-chan, what do you want to drink after your meal?

18:27.240 --> 18:29.620
I'll have oolong tea.

18:29.990 --> 18:32.830
Oh! I'll pour some for you.

18:35.170 --> 18:36.040
Here.

18:36.040 --> 18:37.630
Thanks, Hinata-chan.

18:39.500 --> 18:40.710
Hinata-chan?

18:40.710 --> 18:43.720
You can use my head as your table.

18:43.970 --> 18:45.590
Hey! Hina!

18:45.590 --> 18:48.600
You should give that delicious role to Mokkan!

18:49.560 --> 18:50.680
That's right!

18:50.680 --> 18:52.770
Hasegawa-san belongs to Tomo today!

18:52.770 --> 18:53.600
Oh!

18:53.600 --> 18:54.730
You're right.

18:54.730 --> 18:56.230
Sorry, Tomoka.

18:56.230 --> 18:57.980
Help me out, Airi.

18:57.980 --> 18:58.560
Okay!

19:03.030 --> 19:05.570
Now put her down on top of Hasegawa-san's legs!

19:07.280 --> 19:13.160
Now say, "Use my body however you want!"

19:14.750 --> 19:17.580
Um, you don't have to force yourself.

19:17.580 --> 19:20.340
I-I'm not forcing myself! I'm actually...

19:23.300 --> 19:24.590
Oh!

19:24.590 --> 19:26.880
Hina warmed you up!

19:26.880 --> 19:28.640
Isn't that great, Tomoka-chan?

19:33.350 --> 19:36.140
And so, it's time to present her with her gifts!

19:36.140 --> 19:37.100
Yeah!

19:37.100 --> 19:38.100
I agree!

19:38.100 --> 19:39.400
Oh!

19:41.570 --> 19:43.860
Wow, it's so big!

19:43.860 --> 19:46.950
We all chose this for you.

19:46.950 --> 19:49.530
I hope you'll like it.

19:49.530 --> 19:50.950
Can I open it?

19:50.950 --> 19:52.540
Of course.

19:58.460 --> 19:59.500
This...

19:59.500 --> 20:02.040
I think it'll help you out a lot during practice.

20:02.040 --> 20:08.930
We all want you to use it, all the way
through middle school and high school.

20:08.930 --> 20:09.430
Okay?

20:11.180 --> 20:15.430
You're our older sister!
I want to grow taller, too!
-Hinata

20:11.180 --> 20:15.430
You're amazing at basketball!
I love you!
-Airi

20:11.180 --> 20:15.430
Please continue teaching us!
Let's play a lot of
basketball together!   -Saki

20:11.180 --> 20:15.430
Yaayyy!
You can join the mature
girls' team now!
-Maho

20:11.720 --> 20:12.850
So cute!

20:12.850 --> 20:13.850
Oh!

20:13.850 --> 20:15.430
Hina drew that herself!

20:15.430 --> 20:18.310
Thank you! I'll treasure it!

20:20.060 --> 20:22.150
I have a few things for you, too.

20:22.150 --> 20:26.030
First, this is from Aoi.

20:28.110 --> 20:31.870
So pretty! I'll need to thank her later.

20:33.740 --> 20:35.870
I'm done, Tomoka-chan.

20:37.200 --> 20:39.210
It fits you well!

20:39.210 --> 20:41.920
Oh! You're cute, Tomoka.

20:41.920 --> 20:44.590
As expected of Aoi! Great taste!

20:44.590 --> 20:47.760
Now here's mine.

20:47.760 --> 20:48.720
Here you go.

20:50.380 --> 20:52.890
I'm sorry that it's something so practical.

20:52.890 --> 20:59.230
N-No way! I'm happy with
anything you give me, Subaru.

20:59.230 --> 21:00.730
Thank you very much!

21:00.730 --> 21:04.860
Actually, I have one more thing to give you.

21:23.250 --> 21:24.210
Amazing!

21:24.920 --> 21:26.380
That was just luck.

21:26.380 --> 21:28.010
God must have been on my side.

21:28.880 --> 21:30.420
The floater.

21:30.420 --> 21:33.890
I'll teach it to you as my other present.

21:36.220 --> 21:38.390
Let's continue these practice sessions.

21:38.390 --> 21:39.640
With me included.

21:39.640 --> 21:42.520
I want to master the floater with you, Tomoka.

21:43.440 --> 21:44.480
Okay!

21:45.360 --> 21:47.730
All right. Let's start our practice.

21:56.490 --> 21:59.240
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

21:59.240 --> 22:00.780
Rolling! Rolling!

22:00.780 --> 22:03.700
Keep on bouncing!

22:01.990 --> 22:04.710
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

22:04.710 --> 22:07.120
Elementary schoolers are the best!

22:07.120 --> 22:07.500
Yay!

22:11.590 --> 22:16.590
Our bodies and our hearts are size SS,

22:17.090 --> 22:22.510
but our dreams can be size LL, can't they? Can't they?

22:22.510 --> 22:27.900
Adolescents have lots of troubles,

22:27.900 --> 22:33.480
but we'll overcome them together.

22:33.480 --> 22:38.910
I want to get even better!

22:34.280 --> 22:35.650
Even

22:35.650 --> 22:36.990
better!

22:38.910 --> 22:46.580
I want to see your face when I surprise you!

22:39.870 --> 22:40.530
Ooh!

22:41.200 --> 22:41.910
Wow!

22:46.790 --> 22:49.500
Just keep on spinning!

22:49.500 --> 22:53.420
The Earth is one big basketball!

22:53.420 --> 22:57.090
I'll believe in the future and move forward!

22:56.470 --> 22:58.010
I'll keep going!

22:57.720 --> 23:00.430
Just keep on spinning!

23:00.430 --> 23:04.390
The universe is one big basketball court!

23:04.390 --> 23:07.810
I want you to receive it.

23:07.100 --> 23:08.060
Ready, and!

23:07.810 --> 23:09.650
Pass! Pass! Pass!

23:10.060 --> 23:12.060
Please take it!

23:13.320 --> 23:16.070
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:16.070 --> 23:17.610
Rolling! Rolling!

23:17.610 --> 23:20.490
Keep on bouncing!

23:18.740 --> 23:21.490
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:21.490 --> 23:23.950
Elementary schoolers are the best!

23:23.950 --> 23:25.910
Yay!

23:25.910 --> 23:27.620
We lost, didn't we?

23:27.620 --> 23:29.540
Tomoka was so strong!

23:29.540 --> 23:31.630
We'll get our revenge next time!

23:31.630 --> 23:33.710
We won't lose again to stupid Maho!

23:33.710 --> 23:35.510
I have to get my payback on Saki!

23:35.510 --> 23:38.840
Let's practice so we
can beat the sixth-years!

23:37.930 --> 23:40.960
The Stupid Boy

23:37.930 --> 23:40.960
Next episode

23:38.840 --> 23:39.680
Yeah!
